description:
The Functional Consultant SAP configures, implements, maintains and upgrades functional/business area Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) application modules (e.g., Human Resources, Finance, Supply Chain Management) and Client Relationship Management (CRM) application modules (e.g., Sales, Marketing).




 The Functional Consultant SAP communicates with a company's representatives to develop a business model incorporating SAP products; Applies in-depth knowledge of off-the-shelf applications to efficiently customize modules that maintain full compatibility with vendor guidelines;



* Documents program settings and prepares guidelines;
* Tests system performance and efficiency; Supports tickets and resolves issues;
* Enhances parts of the system according to client specifications;
* Communicates with Technical Consultants SAP on program components;
* Creates models, diagrams and charts to assist application developers.














* **SAP S/4 experience in Procure to Pay processes. Focus on the processes in MM and the Accounts Payable end of P2P.**
* Fluent in English (Swedish is a merit).
* Normal tooling skills; SharePoint, Azure DevOps, etc.
* At least 2 previous SAP S/4 projects
